OL,3,GNEWSACity comes bottom for MMR jabs in
OL,4,Aregion
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a quarter of 5-year-olds
OL,7,Fstarting school in Birmingham this
OL,8,Fautumn are not fully vaccinated against
OL,9,Fmeasles, mumps and rubella, according
OL,10,Fto data from the UK Health Security
OL,11,FAgency (UKHSA).
OL,13,FNew figures place the city bottom of
OL,14,Flocal authorities in the West Midlands,
OL,15,Fwith just 74.1% of children having had
OL,16,Fboth doses of the combined MMR jab,
OL,17,Fcompared to 90.4 in Shropshire.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
