OL,3,GNEWSACity comes bottom for MMR jabs in
OL,4,Aregion
OL,5,
OL,6,FEven a single MMR jab was found to give
OL,7,Fa child up to 93% protection against
OL,8,Fthe diseases. Eight out of every 100
OL,9,Ffive-year-olds have had no inoculations
OL,10,Fwhatsoever.
OL,12,FThe UKHSA is urging parents to make
OL,13,Fsure children are fully vaccinated, to
OL,14,Fprevent a range of serious infections
OL,15,Facross the region.
